\noindent Date: May 09, 2026

\vspace{10pt}
Hiring Manager \\
Nextdoor \\

\vspace{10pt}
Dear Hiring Manager,

Nextdoor’s commitment to fostering local communities through machine learning resonates with me deeply. I admire how the platform leverages personalization to enhance engagement and connection among neighbors. My background in developing ML-driven product components positions me well to support your mission of creating meaningful interactions in neighborhoods. In my previous role, I designed and implemented recommender systems in Python, which directly improved user engagement metrics by over 30\%. This involved iterating on model quality through offline-to-online cycles, ensuring relevance and accuracy in the recommendations provided to users. In addition, I successfully enhanced recommendation algorithms, leading to measurable performance improvements that increased content relevance and user satisfaction. These experiences align with the responsibilities of developing robust, data-intensive products at Nextdoor. I am particularly interested in exploring how machine learning can be integrated with local insights to tailor user interactions and create a more engaged community. In the initial months, I aim to collaborate closely with product and data science teams to refine the machine learning models that power your user experiences. My skills in A/B testing and optimizing algorithm efficiency can contribute to data-driven decisions that enhance user engagement on the platform. I look forward to discussing how my experience can align with Nextdoor’s goals and support the continued growth of your vibrant neighborhood-focused platform.

Sincerely, \\
Sri Akash Kadali \\
kadali18@umd.edu \\
+1 240-726-9356

